mmgraph-agent
=============

This repository is an *independent reproduction* of the MMGraph-Agent
framework and reuses ideas / scaffolding from the following upstream works.
It is not a claim of original authorship over those components.

Upstream projects
-----------------
1. ai-knowledge-graph (Apache-2.0)
   Author : Robert McDermott
   URL    : https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/ai-knowledge-graph
   Role   : the base text-to-knowledge-graph toolkit this reproduction was
            originally forked from; its Apache-2.0 licence is retained here.

2. M3KG-RAG (CVPR 2026) - pipeline design inspiration
   Authors: Hyeongcheol Park et al. (Korea University, Sungkyunkwan
            University, NVIDIA Research, Hanwha Systems)
   URL    : https://kuai-lab.github.io/cvpr2026m3kgrag/
   Role   : multi-hop multimodal KG construction (rewriter / extractor /
            normalizer / searcher / selector / refiner / inspector) and the
            GRASP retrieval refinement idea.

3. MMGraph-Agent (NeurIPS 2026) - the paper being reproduced
   Authors: Haoran Luo et al.
   URL    : https://github.com/LHRLAB/MMGraph-Agent
   Role   : target framework. This repository re-implements its three
            modules (zero-API hypergraph construction, cache-inspired
            L1/L2 memory, GRPO retrieval-and-answer policy) from the paper.

What this repository adds
-------------------------
The three-module reproduction (parser/encoder/builder/store, two-tier
memory, action space + GRPO reward + heuristic demo policy), the CPU-only
smoke pipeline, the evaluation harness, and the project scaffolding in
`src/mmgraph_agent/`.

The full Apache-2.0 licence text is in the LICENSE file.
